      "id": "claim_6dff64cb83ac476aa04e916ef556bcd6",
      "statement": "DjimFlo is an npm-workspaces monorepo with workspaces declared as packages/* in the root package.json, pinning Node >=22 <25 and npm >=9; seven built workspaces (shared, server, dashboard, mcp-server, telegram, agent-catalog, ransomware-module) are all private and versioned together at 0.5.8.",
